WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Pravrudhi-Nyaya. The name and its purpose land on a case-file sheet.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Scope and names. Indian law broadly with a criminal-law focus; Pravrudhi-Nyaya is the product, Prabhāsa-Nyāya our own trained models.

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:19.000
The problem. Fluent AI answers versus a matter that needs every ingredient shown.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.500
Your facts. The live Screening page: the complaint split into numbered facts, the offence ticked.

5
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:32.500
Each ingredient. The live checklist: every ingredient with its status and what to check.

6
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:43.000
A review agenda. The live result on a public order: what is missing for each ingredient and what to check; ends on the standing line.

7
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.500
Two models. Our trained models read each ingredient; both must agree or the matter is referred.

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:59.500
Real field data. Built from real judgments and orders: gathered, cleaned, read by two models and checked, then divided into training, held-out testing and evaluation sets. Evaluation items are checked against training data. Real and constructed cases are labelled.

9
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:05.500
The formal check. Each offence is a formal contract; the check confirms every ingredient was addressed.

10
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:13.500
Nyaya discipline. Three Nyaya ideas that change a result: evidence you can point to, judgment withheld, testimony is checked, not trusted.

11
00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:21.000
The pipeline. The seven stages light up in order, from ingest to decide.

12
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Managed workflows. Optional managed workflows broaden the same core: the assistant proposes, the core decides.

13
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:35.500
What sets it apart. Four differences from general-purpose legal AI.

14
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:43.000
Privacy and cost. Our own models on rented GPUs; the live data-handling page; nothing is billed while idle.

15
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:47.500
End card. Name, line and address.
